 "missing": [],
 "notes": "Verified only the ASCII path the HUD and the container screens draw (hud_mixed, gui_inventory, gui_death pass test_render's budgets); the unicode widths and styles were never exercised. Not gaps (triage 2026-09-25, out/plan/remaining-2026-09-25.md): unicode pages, styles and bidi are unreachable: every string the game draws is ASCII. Formerly listed as missing: The unicode glyph pages (getUnicodePageLocation, loadGlyphTexture, renderUnicodeChar, readGlyphSizes, glyphWidth) have no native counterpart; every recorded overlay string is ASCII. The style variants (bold, italic, underline, strikethrough, randomStyle via fontRandom) and the bidi/Arabic path (func_147647_b, setBidiFlag, getBidiFlag) are not drawn. trimStringToWidth, trimStringNewline and splitStringWidth have no native counterpart; only sizeStringToWidth (size_to_width) and the paragraph splitter are ported. The texture-manager plumbing (the constructor, onResourceManagerReload, renderEngine) has no counterpart: the native font samples the recorder's GL readback (gui_ascii.rgba). lane/hudscreens: strings are UTF-8 decoded against the full glyph table; the section sign counts -1 (it had counted the code's letter); colour codes take their shadow colours; bold, italic, underline, strikethrough and the obfuscated style (fontRandom as the caller seeds it) are drawn."
}